WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:03,360
Aliens injured Tian Qing

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:05,780
I can't take revenge

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:06,780
I'm very unhappy

4
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:10,000
So I want to kill them all

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
You have to die to protect your merits

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Either help me centaurs

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Either go back and tell Ding

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
I won’t play with him anymore

9
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,000
What magic-breaking bow?

10
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Kill a few aliens and force Lai Lai

11
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
