15
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
It's not that you are sick

16
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,330
Do you want to drag the magic bow into the national war?

17
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,040
What are you yelling at?

18
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,040
figure it out

19
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:42,040
It was you who begged me to be a devil

20
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,040
If you don't help me fight, what do I want you to do?

21
00:00:43,040 --> 00:00:45,040
You want to prostitute me for free

22
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:47,040
Income and expenditure are not equal

23
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,040
Chen Haoyu

24
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:50,040
I can only tell you about this battle
